* CMP7345, locally patched; not the upstream release.
* Source: https://github.com/KrzysztofHerman/IHP__CMP7345 at 688ee1cfb81b82e6058699e429825682b25d3002,
* file CMP7345-main/netlist/layout/CMP7345.spice.
* SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
* Changed (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): four Xschem path comments are removed, and
* eleven cards expose the body nets sub! and nw: three .subckt pin lists, three
* x cards and five bulk terminals. See PROVENANCE.md beside this file.
.subckt CMP7345 vdd vout1 vout2 v+ v- clk vss
*.PININFO v-:B v+:B vss:B vdd:B clk:B vout2:B vout1:B
MM7 net1 clk vss sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=6u l=0.13u ng=6 m=1
MMS4 vout2 clk vdd nw sg13_lv_pmos w=3.0u l=0.13u ng=3 m=1
MMS1 P clk vdd nw sg13_lv_pmos w=3.0u l=0.13u ng=3 m=1
MMS2 Q clk vdd nw sg13_lv_pmos w=3.0u l=0.13u ng=3 m=1
MMS3 vout1 clk vdd nw sg13_lv_pmos w=3.0u l=0.13u ng=3 m=1
x2 vout2 vout1 vss P Q vdd sub! cc_pair_nmos
x3 vout2 vout1 vdd vdd vdd vss nw cc_pair_pmos
x1 P Q v+ v- vdd net1 vss sub! diff_pair
.ends

.subckt diff_pair Id1 Id2 v+ v- vdd tail vss sub!
*.PININFO v-:B v+:B vss:B tail:B Id2:B Id1:B vdd:B
MMA1 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA2 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA3 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA4 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB1 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB2 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB3 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB4 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA5 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA6 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA7 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA8 Id2 v- tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB5 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB6 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB7 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB8 Id1 v+ tail sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA9 vss vss Id2 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA10 vss vss Id1 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA11 vss vss Id1 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA12 vss vss Id2 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA13 Id2 vss vss sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA14 Id1 vss vss sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA15 Id1 vss vss sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA16 Id2 vss vss sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
RR1 vss sub! ptap1 A=17.8p P=71.2u
DD1 sub! vdd dantenna A=20.88p P=83.52u m=1
.ends
.subckt cc_pair_nmos Id2 Id1 vss Is1 Is2 vdd sub!
*.PININFO vss:B Id2:B Id1:B Is2:B Is1:B vdd:B
MMA1 Id1 Id2 Is1 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA2 Id1 Id2 Is1 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA3 Id1 Id2 Is1 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMA4 Id1 Id2 Is1 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB1 Id2 Id1 Is2 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
MMB2 Id2 Id1 Is2 sub! sg13_lv_nmos w=1.0u l=0.26u ng=1 m=1
